   "description": "December 2025 is the month the auth story got rebuilt and the platform finished moving to Azure. In potpie, Yash Krishan shipped the SSO implementation (#506) followed by a run of correction PRs — SSO/email auth fixes (#544), Firebase-UID-consistent GitHub linking (#546), and handling for a GitHub account already linked to another user (#549); Deeptendu Santra fixed potpie graph creation (#531) and the GitHub token fallback (#515), while Deepesh Genani chased duplicate logging out of supervisord.conf (#540) and fixed staging logging (#538). Infra-side, the terraform-azure work from October (potpie-aks in Central India, PostgreSQL moved off azurerm_postgresql_flexible_server into a Kubernetes StatefulSet per POSTGRESQL_MIGRATION.md) reached production cutover, which is where the alembic migration-lock incident happened. potpie-ui had a heavy 41-commit month and potpie-workflows saw its first 12 commits. Search terms: December 2025, SSO rollout, Azure cutover, month of the postgres migration lock."
