   "description": "July 2026 opened with potpie 2.0.0 (#991) and a batch of correctness work — the include-family/graph-view vocabulary boundary (POT-1770, #985), graph read filters and text presentation honoring format/detail/relations (#995), infra-topology query-sensitive ranking (#999), and Linear CLI OAuth callback ports (#968). Mid-month Nandan carved the graph core into a potpie-context-core library, moved the CLI, daemon, MCP server and host-app services into the root package, split context-engine dependencies into per-adapter-family extras, and flattened potpie-context-core into a library-shaped package. Shambhavi Shinde upgraded MCP past high-severity advisories (#1014), exposed patched dependency floors in package metadata (#1015), and remediated the Vanta CVE set with torch 2.12.1 (#1000). The month's open operational item is the embedded-FalkorDB claim-read invisibility on falkordb_lite, fixed in PR #1002. Search terms: July 2026, 2.0.0 GA, context-core carve out, falkordb claim invisibility, current month."
