   "summary": "--mode fast|balanced|verify|deep is a documented, echoed, entirely inert knob; --mode garbage is accepted silently.",
   "description": "Filed 2026-07-13 by Aditya Painuli against potpie v2.0.0. `ResolveRequest.mode` and `SearchRequest.mode` have exactly two consumers, both metadata echoes at graph_service.py:125 and :139; nothing in the orchestrator, readers or ranker branches on it, and the only retrieval-shaping preference on the read path is `freshness_preference`. `ResolveMode = str` (domain/ports/agent_context.py:33) keeps the valid values in a comment, so invalid values pass through. The dead knob is advertised on three surfaces: `docs/context-graph/cli-flow.md`, the MCP `context_resolve(mode: str = \"fast\")` signature, and CONTEXT_RESOLVE_RECIPES. Search: inert flag, --mode does nothing, fake parameter, retrieval depth, no validation on mode."
