   "summary": "Primary report of the inverted input contrast bug in components/ui/input.tsx; four further duplicates followed.",
   "description": "Filed by Nandan and still open — the earliest and canonical filing of the greyed-out input box cluster in potpie-ai/potpie-ui. Symptom: 'Input boxes used in the components have an issue where the text is greyed out when filled and when the input block is disabled it shows up as black.' The enabled and disabled foreground tokens on the shared Input primitive are effectively swapped, so filled fields read as inert and disabled fields read as editable. Four near-identical duplicates followed (#207, #209, #211, #213) plus two more in February 2026 (#305, #344, both closed as duplicates on 2026-02-23) — six re-reports and no fix, which makes this the best in-repo illustration of a bug pattern that recurs because it has no owner."
