   "summary": "Persisted and restored prior conversations in the extension sidebar so reloading the VS Code window no longer wipes chat history.",
   "description": "Merged 2026-04-08 by Deepesh Genani. Until this landed, the extension held conversation state only in webview memory: reloading the window, switching workspaces, or letting the extension host restart discarded the chat entirely, which was the single most complained-about behaviour in early dogfooding. The PR persists conversations through src/ConversationStore.ts and restores them into the sidebar on activation, alongside a batch of sidebar UI updates that bring the panel closer to potpie-ui parity. Search terms: chat history lost on reload, conversation gone after restart, extension sidebar redesign."
