   "statement": "The engine's base `Requires-Dist` shrinks to what the public graph API actually imports (pydantic), and Typer/Rich/FastAPI/Uvicorn/MCP/FalkorDB/Neo4j/SQLAlchemy/OpenTelemetry/Sentry each move behind a per-adapter-family extra, with `all` as a self-referential union.",
