   "rationale": "Neo4j was the shape-first production target: mature Cypher, a native relationship vector index for claim embeddings, and an already-running cluster in the potpie-k8s-deployments prod stack (three-server neo4j-cluster plus Neo4j-EE backups) to build against.",
