   "statement": "Semantic search defaults to a dependency-free 256-dimension hashing embedder so that vector search works with no model download and no API key.",
   "rationale": "A hashing vectorizer is instant, offline, deterministic and adds no install weight — attractive for a CLI that must work on first run behind a corporate proxy.",
   "alternatives_rejected": "Bundling a real sentence-transformers model was initially judged too heavy for the default wheel.",
