   "http_method": "POST",
   "path": "/api/v1/context/query/context-graph",
   "summary": "The main read operation — semantic and structural retrieval over a pot's context graph.",
   "description": "Called from potpie-ui's PotContextQueryCard and by agents through the MCP tools. Combines embedder-backed semantic search (see CONTEXT_ENGINE_EMBEDDER) with canonical claim queries in adapters/outbound/graph/canonical_claim_query.py and the analytics/semantic claim-query backends. When the embedder is disabled it degrades to a labelled lexical fallback rather than erroring, which users perceive as 'search got worse' rather than 'search broke'. Search: query the graph, context retrieval, semantic search endpoint, ask the pot, claim query."
