   "description": "Resolved from env or the baked distribution defaults in load_runtime_settings(), then used by adapters/outbound/cli_auth against LINEAR_AUTH_URL https://linear.app/oauth/authorize and LINEAR_TOKEN_URL https://api.linear.app/oauth/token with LINEAR_DEFAULT_SCOPE 'read'. adapters/outbound/cli_auth/oauth_client_id_messages.py exists specifically to explain the missing-client-id case to users. Search: linear oauth, connect linear, client_id missing, POT ticket ingestion, invalid_client."
