   "default": "0",
   "summary": "Opt-out switch for CLI telemetry; accepts the full 0/false/no/off vocabulary.",
   "description": "Parsed by the _flag() helper in runtime_settings.py, which treats 0/false/no/off as false and 1/true/yes/on as true, defaulting to '0' when neither env nor distribution defaults supply a value. Always re-exported to child processes as a normalised '0' or '1' by project_child_environment(). Sits alongside POTPIE_PRODUCT_ANALYTICS_ENABLED and POTPIE_SENTRY_ENABLED as the three privacy switches. Search: disable telemetry, opt out analytics, do not track, offline mode, privacy."
