   "config_key": "daemon_port",
   "env_var": "POTPIE_DAEMON_PORT",
   "summary": "Port the local potpie daemon binds for its HTTP/RPC transport.",
   "description": "Read in the potpie/daemon package alongside POTPIE_DAEMON_TOKEN, which authenticates CLI-to-daemon calls over potpie/daemon/http/transport.py. When unset the daemon picks a free port and records it in the runtime state file under CONTEXT_ENGINE_HOME so daemon_client.py can find it. Stale state after an unclean shutdown produces 'connection refused' on a port nothing is listening on. Search: potpie daemon port, daemon not reachable, stale pid file, restart daemon."
