   "description": "The timeline skill. Its fast path reads the project timeline first with `potpie graph read --subgraph recent_changes --view timeline --format table --time-window 7d --limit 20`, and it carries an important scoping rule: a pot is the project boundary and can contain multiple repos, so do not narrow to the current repo unless the user asks. It instructs the agent to use the user's exact dates when provided, and covers ingesting source history from GitHub, Linear, Jira, docs and deployment records. This is the skill behind questions like 'what changed last week', 'when did this regress', 'which PR touched this file', 'what shipped before the incident'."
