   "description": "The control-plane surface for workspaces. `potpie source add repo .` is generic registration only — it performs no scan or ingest, and registering a repo also sets the repo default binding. `potpie source status` with no id prints a per-pot summary of all sources; with an id it reports one source. `potpie pot reset [--confirm]` is the destructive per-pot wipe. Fixed real bugs in this area: `pot create --repo .` failing to register the current repo (potpie#973, PR #974), pot resolution reason missing from `source list` output (PR #937), and empty-pot recovery guidance surfacing too late (potpie#971/#978). Search terms: pot list, pot use, source add repo, pot has 0 claims, which pot am I in."
